            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Devices and methods utilizing sorbent polymer composite materials in the form of at least one sheet. The at least one sheet can have a plurality of perforations that aids in the formation of an internal liquid network. In some embodiments, each perforation of the plurality of perforations has a size ranging from 0.1 mm to 6.5 mm and the at least one sheet has a perforation density ranging from 0.14% to 50% based on a total surface area of the at least one sheet.</p>
